# Who must approve a pull request, by path. Takes effect with branch protection
# (or a ruleset) on main that requires review from code owners.
# Replace @your-org/databricks-platform with your teams, for example @<org>/databricks-platform and
# @<org>/security. The last matching line wins.

# Everything else (the configuration): the platform team.
*                                   @your-org/databricks-platform

# Code that runs with the workspace credentials (plan, apply, drift, AI review):
# a change here can do anything the pipeline identity can, so it needs the platform team.
/terraform/                         @your-org/databricks-platform
/scripts/                           @your-org/databricks-platform
/.github/                           @your-org/databricks-platform

# The security settings every workspace gets (legacy access, DBFS, isolation, tokens, downloads):
# the platform team and security. Add your security team here.
/config/defaults/settings.yaml      @your-org/databricks-platform @your-org/security
